{"id":"wb-8-205","name":"涉县清泉寺","retrievedAt":"2026-11-06T11:54:03+00:00","status":"ready","title":"涉县清泉寺","text":"涉县清泉寺建于北齐天统年间，因寺东有甘美清香的泉水而得名。现位于河北省邯郸市涉县东南15里的石岗村南。2019年10月，被中华人民共和国国务院列为第八批全国重点文物保护单位。","shortened":false,"sourceUrl":"https://zh.wikipedia.org/wiki/%E6%B6%89%E5%8E%BF%E6%B8%85%E6%B3%89%E5%AF%BA","revisionId":88745492,"revisionUrl":"https://zh.wikipedia.org/w/index.php?oldid=88745492","license":"CC BY-SA 4.0","licenseUrl":"https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/4.0/","authors":"维基百科贡献者","matchEvidence":"名称与地理坐标一致","image":null}